{"t":"CCL","n":"Carnival Corporation Ltd.","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":27.91,"chg":1.32,"chgPct":0.04964,"prev":26.59,"dayH":28.36,"dayL":27.64,"w52H":34.03,"w52L":21.45,"vol":15488427,"avgVol":14654280,"mcap":37528068096,"pe":12.3,"fpe":10.81,"eps":2.27,"feps":2.58,"pb":2.66,"div":0.6,"divY":0.0215,"beta":2.46,"short":40533263,"shortPct":0.0325,"shortRatio":1.96,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Cyclical","sKo":"소비자 경기순환","i":"Travel Services","iKo":"여행 서비스","city":"Miami","emp":160000,"web":"https://www.carnivalcorp.com","sum":"Carnival Corporation Ltd., a cruise company, provides leisure travel services. The company operates through four segments: North America Cruise Operations, Europe Cruise Operations, Cruise Support, and Tour and Other. It operates port destinations and islands, as well as owns and operates hotels, lodges, glass-domed railcars, and motorcoaches. The company offers its services under the AIDA Cruises, Carnival Cruise Line, Costa Cruises, Cunard, Holland America Line, P&O Cruises (Australia), P&O Cruises (UK), Princess Cruises, and Seabourn brands. It sells its cruises through travel agents, tour operators, vacation planners, websites, and onboard future cruise consultants. Carnival Corporation Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Miami, Florida.","sumKo":"크루즈 회사인 Carnival Corporation Ltd.는 레저 여행 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 북미 크루즈 운영, 유럽 크루즈 운영, 크루즈 지원, 투어 및 기타 등 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 항구 목적지와 섬을 운영할 뿐만 아니라 호텔, 롯지, 유리 돔 철도 차량 및 버스를 소유하고 운영합니다. 이 회사는 AIDA Cruises, Carnival Cruise Line, Costa Cruises, Cunard, Holland America Line, P&O Cruises(호주), P&O Cruises(영국), Princess Cruises 및 Seabourn 브랜드로 서비스를 제공합니다. 여행사, 여행사, 휴가 기획자, 웹사이트, 미래의 크루즈 컨설턴트를 통해 크루즈 상품을 판매합니다. Carnival Corporation Ltd.는 1972년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 마이애미에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":12168000000,"ni":-6093000000},{"y":2023,"rev":21593000000,"ni":-74000000},{"y":2024,"rev":25021000000,"ni":1916000000},{"y":2025,"rev":26622000000,"ni":2760000000}],"quart